      "html": "<section class=\"ds-demo\" aria-label=\"Näidisvestlus\"><div class=\"ds-demo-prompt\">Kas minu API lubab volitamata ligipääsu?<button class=\"ds-demo-send\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Saada küsimus\"><svg class=\"ds-demo-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-demo-answers\"><article class=\"ds-demo-card ds-cloud\"><strong>Pilve-AI</strong><p>Ma ei saa haavatavusi aidata.</p></article><article class=\"ds-demo-card ds-ours\"><strong>Tehisabiline</strong><p>Testi ainult oma süsteemi kirjaliku loaga.</p><span class=\"ds-chip\">Kohe</span></article></div></section>",
